    "We handle steel stud and wood frame commercial construction across Palmetto and Manatee County. Our framing teams work from architectural drawings, coordinate with your MEP subcontractors, and frame to specification so downstream trades can stay on schedule.",
    "Gulfway is a licensed general contractor — which means we don't just frame, we manage. If you need framing as part of a larger scope, we can handle the full project from permits to CO."
  ]}
  bullets={[
    "Steel stud & wood frame commercial construction",
    "Interior partitions & demising walls",
    "Ceiling grid & soffit framing",
